RESOLUTION NO.
ENTITLED:  "A RESOLUTION RE-APPROPRIATING THE FISCAL YEAR 2016 BUDGET OF THE CITY OF
     CHEYENNE ACCORDING TO THE PROVISIONS OF W.S. 16-4-112 & 16-4-113."
BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING:
